# The source language packs, deliberately, and only for now.
#
# The old ignore list carried a bare `languages` entry, meant for the build
# output. An unanchored pattern matches a directory of that name at ANY depth,
# so it also excluded hyperformula/src/i18n/languages/ - and the `sort-keys`
# override that targets those files has therefore never run. Anchoring the
# build-output entry below exposed 881 pre-existing violations in them.
#
# Sorting 19 translation files is a change of its own, not a side effect of
# moving directories around. Delete this entry in that change.
hyperformula/src/i18n/languages

